<title>CANADA: Oshawa Group Ltd Q2 Aug 10 net drops.</title>
<headline>Oshawa Group Ltd Q2 Aug 10 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 ended August 10</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.47		   C$0.61</p>
<p> Net			 17,800		   23,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,964,100		1,929,600</p>
<p>	   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.76	   C$0.89</p>
<p> Net			 28,900	   33,700</p>
<p> Revs		3,359,000		3,293,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Second quarter in 1995 ended August 12. The supermarket and drugstore chain operator said 1996 second quarter earnings reflected start-up costs for programs to strengthen retail competitiveness.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
